    "background_story": "Amber was a bright and ambitious event planner in her late 20s. Despite her profession, which often involved coordinating lavish parties and weddings, she had always been a teetotaler. Growing up in a family affected by substance abuse, Amber had made a conscious decision to abstain from alcohol and other substances. Her friends and colleagues admired her conviction and discipline. As her business grew, Amber began to specialize in planning sober events and retreats, catering to a growing demand for alcohol-free celebrations. Her unique approach and expertise earned her a reputation as a pioneer in the industry. Amber's teetotaler lifestyle not only improved her own well-being but also inspired others to reevaluate their relationship with substances.",
